msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ami「Oh......」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yo. We meet again.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hola. Nos volvemos a ver.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And if that was the case?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y si así fuera?」"

msgid "Ami「You've worn out that joke.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya gastaste esa broma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that was pretty bad.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, estuvo bastante mala.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, I know. Takasu-kun, you probably＿know about the bakeries and stuff＿around here, right?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, ya sé. Takasu-kun, tú seguro＿sabes de las pastelerías y esas＿cosas por aquí, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you think the other girls would＿know more about that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No crees que las otras chicas＿sabrían más sobre eso?」"

msgid "Ami「Well, to an extent, yes. But you see, I＿think I can better rely on someone＿known for good cooking, like you.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, hasta cierto punto, sí. Pero＿verás, creo que puedo confiar más en＿alguien famoso por cocinar bien como tú.」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu-kun, you seem like just the＿type to get upset after buying＿something that sucks.」"
msgstr "Ami「Takasu-kun, pareces justo el tipo＿de persona que se enoja tras comprar＿algo que sea un asco.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, just what the hell do you think of＿me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, ¿qué diablos piensas＿exactamente de mí?」"

msgid "Ami「Well? Remember anything?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y bien? ¿Recuerdas algo?」"

msgid "Ami「Hmm, you're doing well.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmm, vas bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did you ask me that on purpose＿because you were worried about how＿I'm doing?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Me preguntaste eso a propósito porque＿estabas preocupada por cómo estoy?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, Taiga mentioned it too. Are＿you going to buy one tonight?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí, Taiga también lo mencionó.＿¿Vas a comprar uno esta noche?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, are you going to see Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, vas a ver a Taiga?」"

msgid "Ami「I'm not in a rush or anything, but＿tonight's just the most convenient for＿me.」"
msgstr "Ami「No tengo prisa ni nada, pero＿esta noche es simplemente cuando＿más me conviene.」"

msgid "Ami「......So? What store does the cooking＿freak overlord Takasu-kun＿recommend?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Y bien? ¿Qué tienda recomienda＿el señor supremo de los maniáticos＿de la cocina, Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ami「Tarte tatin from Alps? Thanks! Bye.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Tarte tatin de Alps? ¡Gracias! Adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Bye.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Well, damn if she isn't bizarrely＿enthusiastic...... Is that part of the＿\"tsundere\" thing?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Vaya, sí que está extrañamente＿entusiasmada...... ¿Eso es parte＿de lo \"tsundere\"?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yo.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hola.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh...... what is it?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah...... ¿qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I'm not on any particular errand.＿You've been staring into that cake＿display pretty intently.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, no vengo por nada en especial.＿Llevas un buen rato mirando esa vitrina＿de pasteles con mucha atención.」"

msgid "Ami「Well, yeah. I have to choose carefully,＿don't I? I can't just eat as many of＿these high-calorie things as I want.」"
msgstr "Ami「Pues sí. Tengo que elegir con cuidado,＿¿no? No puedo comer tantas cosas altas＿en calorías como quiera.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Makes sense. Spoiling yourself?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tiene sentido. ¿Consintiéndote?」"

msgid "Ami「......Hmph, don't make me laugh. That＿phrase sounds like it came out of a＿women's magazine.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Jum, no me hagas reír. Esa frase＿suena sacada de una revista femenina.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My mom Yasuko reads them. It's a＿common phrase these days.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mi mamá Yasuko las lee. Es una＿frase común hoy en día.」"

msgid "Ami「So this is just me scratching an itch.＿I'd be concerned if I got \"spoiled.\"」"
msgstr "Ami「Esto es solo quitarme un antojo. Me＿preocuparía si me volviera \"consentida\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're pretty serious about this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te lo tomas bastante en serio.」"

msgid "Ami「If I wasn't, I couldn't be a model...... See＿ya.」"
msgstr "Ami「Si no fuera así, no podría ser＿modelo...... Nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, you're not going to buy anything＿after all?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, al final no vas a comprar nada?」"

msgid "Ami「I feel full after looking at your face～」"
msgstr "Ami「Me llené solo con ver tu cara～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......The fuck did that mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué mierda significó eso?」"

msgid "Ami「What? After having the gall to＿abandon Ami-chan earlier, you're just＿so interested in her that you couldn't」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué? Tras el descaro＿de dejar sola a Ami-chan antes,＿¿te interesa tanto que no podías」"

msgid "Ami「stop looking for her?」"
msgstr "Ami「dejar de buscarla?」"

msgid "Ami「Actually, you'd say you could make＿something better, I know it. Or maybe＿you'd say you'd prove it to yourself～ I」"
msgstr "Ami「De hecho, dirías que puedes hacer algo＿mejor, lo sé. O tal vez dirías que te＿lo demostrarías a ti mismo～ ¡Me」"

msgid "Ami「can totally see that happening!＿Hilarious～」"
msgstr "Ami「lo imagino totalmente! ¡Qué risa～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Uhhh, let's see. Come to think of it,＿Yasuko's gotten a few decent-tasting＿cakes...... Oh, a good candidate just」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ehhh, a ver. Pensándolo bien,＿Yasuko ha traído pasteles ricos......＿Ah, un buen candidato acaba de」"

msgid "Ryuuji「came to mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「venirme a la mente.」"

msgid "Ami「Like hell. I merely figured you'd have＿bought a few for the runt Tiger, and I＿just wanted reliable information with」"
msgstr "Ami「Ni de broma. Supuse que le habrías＿comprado varios a la enana de Tigre y＿solo quería información fiable」"

msgid "Ami「no complaints.」"
msgstr "Ami「sin quejas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Excuse you...... Well, as I recall, just＿past this shopping mall, there's a＿pastry shop called \"Alps.\" They make a」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Más respeto...... Que yo recuerde,＿pasando este centro comercial hay una＿pastelería llamada \"Alps\". Hacen una」"

msgid "Ryuuji「decent tarte tatin.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tarte tatin bastante buena.」"

msgid "Ami「Something like \"spoiling myself①\" is＿just a convenient excuse for people＿who don't want to feel guilty about」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Algo como \"consentirme①\" es solo una＿excusa conveniente para quienes no＿quieren sentirse culpables por」"

msgid "Ami「overspending or overeating!」"
msgstr "Ami「gastar o comer de más!」"

msgid "Ami「In short, it's just a way to overlook＿your own weak will. If I hear someone＿say it, it's like, are you really motivated」"
msgstr "Ami「En resumen, es solo una forma de ignorar＿tu poca fuerza de voluntad. Si alguien＿lo dice, es como: ¡¿de verdad」"

msgid "Ami「to lose weight!?」"
msgstr "Ami「tienes motivación para bajar de peso?!」"
